{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:01.98]Ooh\n[00:03.80]Oh, oh, oh, oh, yeah\n[00:07.56]Bitches on me, that's often\n[00:09.20]Doin' them beans often\n[00:09.88]Purps on the beat\n[Chorus]\n[00:14.72]She know me well, well, well, she know me well (Uh-huh)\n[00:18.54]Told me she loved me still, bitch, go to hell (Uh-huh)\n[00:22.40]All the drugs I did, it was worth it (Yeah)\n[00:26.16]Super worth it (Uh)\n[00:28.32]Tell me why you had me feelin' worthless (Yeah)\n[00:32.34]Now your heart broken, you need a surgeon (Yeah)\n[00:36.24]I know one thing for sure, one thing for certain (Yeah)\n[00:40.00]I know one thing's for sure, one thing's for certain (Yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:45.04]We ain't gon' do this, not again\n[00:48.56]Gucci cardigan, I'm the fliest gent\n[00:52.84]I found out what the problem is, breakin' promises\n[00:58.02]It was the both of us\n[Refrain]\n[00:59.30]Oh, all girls the same, same, same (Same, same same)\n[01:05.18]Two blue pills to the brain, brain, brain (Two blue pills to the brain, brain, brain)\n[01:13.36]Yeah, I kinda miss your brain\n[01:14.58]And I bet you miss my fame\n[Chorus]\n[01:16.20]She know me well, well, well, she know me well (Uh-huh)\n[01:19.48]Told me she loved me still, bitch, go to hell (Uh-huh)\n[01:23.36]All the drugs I did, it was worth it (Yeah)\n[01:27.10]Super worth it (Uh)\n[01:29.46]Tell me why you had me feelin' worthless (Yeah)\n[01:33.28]Now your heart broken, you need a surgeon (Yeah)\n[01:37.18]I know one thing for sure, one thing for certain (Yeah)\n[01:41.02]I know one thing's for sure, one thing's for certain (Yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:46.84]I bet I'll never die again\n[01:49.52]Bullets fly again, Cupid hit his target\n[01:54.52]Guess he's been target practicing\n[01:57.12]Devils panickin', it makes it worse for my heart (Worse for my heart)\n[Refrain]\n[02:01.58]All girls aren't the same, same, same\n[02:05.74]But, it's still two pills to the brain, brain, brain (Brain, brain, brain)\n[02:10.40]I hope you never change, change, change\n[02:13.64]I also hope we put the drugs away (Also hope we put the drugs away)\n[Verse 3]\n[02:19.00]Well, well, well, well\n[02:19.88]She do me well (Uh, huh)\n[02:20.78]I hope she loves me for real 'cause I been through hell (Uh, huh)\n[02:23.88]All the drugs I did\n[02:26.18]They weren't worth it, now I'm worthless (They weren't worth it, now I'm worthless)\n[02:30.54]I hope my new lady thinks I'm perfect, oh (Thinks I'm perfect)\n[02:34.24]Sometimes I feel like that she'll be better off (Better off)\n[02:37.88]Without me but without her, I would die, oh (I would die, oh)\n[02:43.48]I would die, oh (Die, oh)\n[Chorus]\n[02:47.10]She know me well, well, well, she know me well (Uh-huh)\n[02:50.92]Told me she loved me still, bitch, go to hell (Uh-huh)\n[02:54.80]All the drugs I did, it was worth it (Yeah)\n[02:58.54]Super worth it (Uh)\n[03:00.90]Tell me why you had me feelin' worthless (Yeah)\n[03:04.72]Now your heart broken, you need a surgeon (Yeah)\n[03:08.64]I know one thing for sure, one thing for certain (Yeah)\n[03:12.44]I know one thing's for sure, one thing's for certain (Yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[03:14.92]Told me she loved me still, bitch, go to hell (Uh-huh, Uh-huh)\n[03:16.70]All the drugs I did, it was worth it (Yeah)\n[03:18.62]Super worth it (Uh)\n[03:19.34]Tell me why you had me feelin' worthless (Yeah)\n[03:21.60]Now your heart broken, you need a surgeon (Yeah)\n[03:23.24]I know one thing for sure, one thing for certain (Yeah, start from right there)\n[03:25.50]I know one thing's for sure, one thing's for certain (Yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[Chorus 2]\n[03:27.38]I'm off of the pills, all in it\n[03:28.28]House in the hills, ballin'\n[03:29.02]Blue-face bill, sad money\n[03:29.54]Look at her tears, fallin'\n[03:30.28]I see Cupid's carcass, I'm the one who shot him\n[03:31.92]We had too many problems, was no way to solve 'em\n[Post-Second Chorus]\n[03:33.46]I'm through with this broad, I'm finna go and marry the diamonds\n[03:37.08]She got too many flaws, look at my VVS's, flawless\n[03:40.56]I had my dick in her jaw, then she suck it 'til she jawless\n[03:45.28]Had my heart involved till she fucked around and lost it, yeah\n[Verse 4]\n[03:49.56]Uh, fuck, real\n[03:50.48]I know you still wanna fuck still\n[03:52.36]You wish that I was in-love still\n[03:54.24]They ain't gon' love you like I did\n[03:56.16]You put up our business in public, just like a dumb bitch\n[03:59.52]What the fuck? Three in the morning, texting me off some drunk shit, just give it up (Ohh)\n[Bridge]\n[04:25.50]I'm on a whole 'nother level\n[04:27.08]I'm high as hell in here, I bought whole 'nother devil\n[04:29.42]Oh, I'm on a whole 'nother level\n[04:30.36]I'm high as hell in here, I bought whole 'nother devil\n[Chorus 2]\n[04:34.04]I'm off of the pills, all in it\n[04:36.16]House in the hills, ballin'\n[04:38.08]Blue-face bill, sad money\n[04:39.70]Look at her tears, fallin'\n[04:43.56]I see Cupid's carcass, I'm the one who shot him\n[04:55.20]We had too many problems, was no way to solve 'em\n[Post-Second Chorus]\n[04:59.08]I'm through with this broad, I'm finna go and marry a diamond\n[05:06.14]She got too many flaws, look at my VVS, it's flawless\n[05:10.16]I had my dick in her jaw then she suck it 'til she jawless\n[05:13.26]Had my heart involved till she fucked around and lost it, Yeah\n[Chorus]\n[05:18.68]She know me well, well, well, she know me well (Uh-huh)\n[05:30.74]Told me she loved me still, bitch, go to hell (Uh-huh)\n[05:35.34]All the drugs I did, it was worth it (Yeah)\n[05:39.26]Super worth it (Uh)\n[05:40.68]Tell me why you had me feelin' worthless (Yeah)\n[05:44.66]Now your heart broken, you need a surgeon (Yeah)\n[05:47.66]I know one thing for sure, one thing for certain (Yeah)\n[05:58.38]I know one thing's for sure, one thing's for certain (Yeah, yeah, yeah)","words":[[1.98,3.74,"Ooh"],[3.8,3.96,"Oh,"],[4.0,4.08,"oh,"],[4.12,4.66,"oh,"],[4.76,5.66,"oh,"],[5.7,7.1,"yeah"],[7.56,7.9,"Bitches"],[7.